  "body": "Be the first to experience the blend of luxury and comfort in this brand-new property. It's a lifestyle worth indulging in. Situated on a 451sqm (approx.) section and 290.2sqm (approx.) floor area. Completed and ready to go, this is a top quality build with executive finishes throughout with the balance of 10 Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n\r\nThis property boasts dual access entry, making it ideal for families who value independence. Live together yet maintain separate spaces. The main entry and double garage located on Harvest Ave and the granny's entry is on Manawanui Way with parking spots.\r\n\r\nThis property features 6 bedrooms, 5.5 bathrooms (3 ensuite) and 3 family rooms, there's ample space for a large family and guests. Light and bright family spaces flow out onto a level sun-drenched garden. With dual kitchens, you'll never run out of space to create culinary masterpieces. With a second kitchen that seamlessly connects to a private granny suite (1 bedroom + 1 living room + 1 bathroom), you'll have the flexibility to accommodate extended family like grandparents or teenagers.\r\n\r\nStep to the stairs, you'll surprised with the design feature wall that isn't just visually striking; it also adds texture and depth to the space. Escape to the tranquil upstairs retreat, where the water bar beckons. Room for everyone! Five bedrooms upstairs offer privacy and tranquility. With three ensuites upstairs, this property redefines comfort. Each bedroom has its own bathroom, making mornings a breeze and pampering a pleasure.\r\n\r\nParking will never be a worry with a double internally accessed garage, along with off-street parkings. Just a 10-minute walk to Orewa Primary School! Enjoy the convenience of a nearby path right from your backyard. No more long commutes or waiting for the bus. Explore nearby parks, shopping centres, and motorway, all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this opportunity! Contact our friendly agent now to schedule a private viewing who can arrive within 10 minutes.",
